---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_settled: isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_not_canceled: sale not canceled
    q_check_settled --> q_calc_amount: investorPosition[investor].hasSettled == false
    q_check_settled --> q_revert_settled: already settled
    q_calc_amount --> q_set_settled: amount = investorPosition[investor].investedCapital
    q_set_settled --> q_transfer: investorPosition[investor].hasSettled = true
    q_transfer --> q_emit: bidToken.transfer(investor, amount)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit CanceledCapitalWithdrawn(investor, amount)
    q_revert_not_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleNotCanceled
    q_revert_settled --> [*]: revert AlreadySettled

    note right of q_set_settled
        INV-001: hasSettled prevents double withdrawal
        INV-002: full investedCapital returned (no fees on canceled sales)
        INV-003: state updated before transfer (CEI pattern)
    end note
